From 8f9984d2342c73e27631abc7c9267832dea9632b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 20:54:00 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] v4.82.0: Ready for update on the public Update history link
 and in Update Summaries

A summary means the installer for that update is built, so the newest update of
each product is marked "Ready for update"; older ones are "Earlier update".
The public page can show only ready or earlier updates, and an issue-number
search says whether its installer is ready.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01H4HCoUKXxT2FPRsVf3Hb2Z
